"""Runners that execute TVBO simulations on different backends.

This package collects the execution helpers used once a model and connectome are assembled: the study run that `tvbo run` and `SimulationStudy.run()` share — experiments, analyses, figures and the provenance of every container ([`tvbo.run.study`](/api/run/study.qmd)) — graph-based integration of a connectome as a network of coupled local models ([`GraphRunner`](/api/run/graph.qmd#GraphRunner)), the stepping and coupling helpers it builds on ([`tvbo.run.compgraph`](/api/run/compgraph.qmd)), low-level utilities for running TVBO-generated Julia code ([`tvbo.run.julia`](/api/run/julia.qmd)), the workflow planner that splits a sweep between what a backend vectorises and what a Slurm, Snakemake or Nextflow kit fans out ([`tvbo.run.workflow`](/api/run/workflow.qmd)), and the backend capability table it reads ([`tvbo.run.backends`](/api/run/backends.qmd)).
"""
